WEBVTT

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:31.412
u mnogim različitim sredinama,

00:13:31.412 --> 00:13:33.233
i možemo naučiti iz ovoga

00:13:33.233 --> 00:13:35.010
o drugim sistemima koji rade

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.347
bez centralne kontrole.

00:13:37.347 --> 00:13:39.326
Koristeći samo proste interakcije,

00:13:39.326 --> 00:13:42.361
kolonije mrava vrše neverovatne podvige

00:13:42.361 --> 00:13:44.754
više od 130 miliona godina.

00:13:44.754 --> 00:13:46.894
Imamo mnogo da naučimo od njih.

00:13:46.894 --> 00:13:49.062
Hvala vam.

00:13:49.062 --> 00:13:51.535
(Aplauz)